sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    box rgb(238,248,242) GUI thread
        participant V as ImageViewerWidget<br/>(passive view)
        participant W as VideoWindow<br/>(wiring)
        participant C as VideoController
    end
    box rgb(255,246,236) Qt Multimedia backend
        participant S as Video source<br/>(camera or media file)
    end
    box rgb(244,245,255) Processing thread
        participant T as VideoProcessingThread
        participant A as ActiveContour
    end

    Note over W,T: Commands: from the window to the algorithm

    W->>C: start streaming, apply session settings
    C->>S: open and play
    C->>T: setAlgoConfig(session)

    Note over S,V: For each video frame

    loop while streaming
        S-->>C: videoFrameChanged(frame)
        C->>T: submitFrame(frame)
        Note right of T: only the latest frame is kept,<br/>older frames are dropped
        T->>T: convert, downscale, filter
        T->>A: update(image)
        loop until the time budget is spent
            T->>A: runCycles(1)
        end
        T-->>C: processedFrameReady(image, contours)
        C->>C: build the point layers (presentation)
        C-->>V: displayFrameReady(image, layers)
        Note over C,V: connected by VideoWindow
        V-->>C: frameDisplayed(timestamps)
        Note left of C: statistics: received, processed,<br/>displayed frames
    end

    W->>C: stop
    C->>S: stop
